"Cable Leg Extension":{m:["quads"],eq:"cable",fam:"legext",i:"Ankle strap on the low pulley. Straighten the knee against the cable, hold at the top."},
"Lying Leg Curl":{m:["hamstrings"],eq:"machine",fam:"legcurl",i:"Hips flat on the pad. Curl the heels to the glutes, lower slowly."},
"Seated Leg Curl":{m:["hamstrings"],eq:"machine",fam:"legcurl",i:"Pad above the ankles, thigh clamp snug. Drive the heels down and under."},
"Standing Leg Curl":{m:["hamstrings"],eq:"machine",fam:"legcurl",i:"One leg at a time, hips still. Curl the heel toward the glute."},
"Glute Ham Raise":{m:["hamstrings","glutes"],eq:"body",fam:"legcurl",i:"Ankles anchored. Lower under control as far as you can, then pull back with the hamstrings."},
"Ball Leg Curl":{m:["hamstrings","glutes"],eq:"body",fam:"legcurl",i:"Heels on a stability ball, hips lifted. Pull the ball in with the hamstrings, keep the hips up."},
